{
  "2TH.1": {
    "id": "2TH.1",
    "number": "1",
    "bookId": "2TH",
    "reference": "2 Jo-Thesalonika 1",
    "copyright": "Biblica® Ochiw Thuolo Motingʼo Loko Manyien™ Weg Loko © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 otim gi Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open New Luo Translation™ Copyright © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" en sai mondik mongorore e piny Amerika kendo en kido moyie malongʼo e ofis Biblica, Inc. Itiyo kode gi thuolo moa kuom Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
    "verseCount": 12,
    "content": [
      {
        "name": "chapter",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "number": "1",
          "style": "c",
          "sid": "2TH 1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "1",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "1",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 1:1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "1",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "An Paulo gi Sila kod Timotheo,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.1.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.1.1"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "b",
          "vid": "2TH 1:1"
        },
        "items": []
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p",
          "vid": "2TH 1:1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Wandikonu un kanisa mar jo-Thesalonika, man kuom Nyasaye Wuonwa kod Ruoth Yesu Kristo:",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.1.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.1.1"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "b"
        },
        "items": []
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "2",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 1:2"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "2",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Ngʼwono gi kwe moa kuom Nyasaye Wuoro kod Ruoth Yesu Kristo obed kodu.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.1.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.1.2"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "b"
        },
        "items": []
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Lemo kod dwoko erokamano",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "3",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 1:3"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "3",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Nyaka wadwokne Nyasaye erokamano kinde duto nikech un jowetewa kendo owinjore watim kamano nikech yie ma un-go medo bedo motegno, kendo hera muherorugo ngʼato gi ngʼato bende medore.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.1.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.1.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "4",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 1:4"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "4",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Kuom mano, wasebedo ka wapwoyou e kind kanisa Nyasaye, kawanyisogi kuom kindau kod yieu motegno momiyo udhil e dier sand kod tem duto muyudo.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.1.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.1.4"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "5",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 1:5"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "5",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Magi duto nyiso ni buch Nyasaye nikare, nikech bangʼ neno sand kod tem to e giko nokwanu kaka joma owinjore yudo gweth mar pinyruoth Nyasaye.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.1.5",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.1.5"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "6",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 1:6"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "6",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Nyasaye en ngʼama kare omiyo obiro kumo joma sandou,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.1.6",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.1.6"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "7",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 1:7"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "7",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "to un muyudo sand obiro miyou yweyo, kaachiel kodwa. Mano notimre chiengʼ ma Ruoth Yesu nofwenyre e mach makakni kolor oa e polo, kaachiel gi malaika mage maroteke.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.1.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.1.7"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "8",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 1:8"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "8",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Enokum joma okia Nyasaye kendo ma ok orito puonj mar Injili mar Ruodhwa Yesu.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.1.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.1.8"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "9",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 1:9"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "9",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Giniyud kum ma en lal manyaka chiengʼ, koriembogi oko e nyim Ruoth Nyasaye kendo mabor gi tekone man-gi duongʼ.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.1.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.1.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "10",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 1:10"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "10",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "En odiechiengʼ ma Ruoth noduogie mondo joge maler omiye duongʼ kendo joma oyie duto omiye luor. Un bende unubed achiel kuom jogo, nikech ne uyie wach mane wakelonu.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.1.10",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.1.10"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "11",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 1:11"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "11",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Ka un gi gima chalo kama e pachu, to mano emomiyo walamonu kinde duto, mondo omi Nyasachwa okwanu kaka joma owinjore gi luongne, mondo tekone ochop dwaro mabeyo duto ma un-go kod tije duto mutimo nikech yie ma un-go.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.1.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.1.11"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "12",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 1:12"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "12",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Walemo ni mondo nying Ruodhwa Yesu Kristo oyud duongʼ kuomu, kendo mondo un bende uyud duongʼ kuome. Mano mondo otimrenu kuom ngʼwono mar Nyasachwa kod Ruoth Yesu Kristo.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.1.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.1.12"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "next": {
      "id": "2TH.2",
      "number": "2",
      "bookId": "2TH"
    },
    "previous": {
      "id": "2TH.intro",
      "number": "intro",
      "bookId": "2TH"
    }
  },
  "2TH.2": {
    "id": "2TH.2",
    "number": "2",
    "bookId": "2TH",
    "reference": "2 Jo-Thesalonika 2",
    "copyright": "Biblica® Ochiw Thuolo Motingʼo Loko Manyien™ Weg Loko © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 otim gi Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open New Luo Translation™ Copyright © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" en sai mondik mongorore e piny Amerika kendo en kido moyie malongʼo e ofis Biblica, Inc. Itiyo kode gi thuolo moa kuom Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
    "verseCount": 17,
    "content": [
      {
        "name": "chapter",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "number": "2",
          "style": "c",
          "sid": "2TH 2"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "2",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Ngʼat mochayo Chik",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "1",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "1",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "To koro owetewa, kuom wach biro mar Ruodhwa Yesu Kristo kendo kaka ibiro chokowa kanyakla mondo waromne,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.1"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "2",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:2"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "2",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "wakwayou mondo kik uparru kendo kik chunyu chandre ni weche mokor, kata weche mokelnu, kata baruwa moro miwacho ni oa irwa, mawacho ni odiechiengʼ mar Ruoth osechopo.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.2"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "3",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:3"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "3",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Kik uyie ngʼato wuondu e yo moro amora, nikech odiechiengʼno ok nobi nyaka ngʼanyo maduongʼ chopi, kendo nyaka ngʼat mochayo chik fwenyre, ma en jal mochanne tho e mach manyaka chiengʼ.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "4",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:4"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "4",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Obiro sungore kokwedo gimoro amora miluongo ni Nyasaye kata gimoro amora milamo. Bende nohedhre bet kata ei hekalu mar Nyasaye kolandore owuon ni en Nyasaye.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.4"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "5",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:5"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "5",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Donge unyalo paro ni ne anyisou gigi kane an kodu?",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.5",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.5"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "6",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:6"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "6",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "To koro ungʼeyo gima pod omone fwenyore, ni nyaka obi mana e kinde moketne.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.6",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.6"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "7",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:7"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "7",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Teko mopondo mar tij chayo chik koro osechako tich. To ka jal motamo ngʼat mochayo chik ogol oko, to tekono nofwenyre.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.7"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "8",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:8"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "8",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Bangʼe jal mochayo chik nofwenyre, to Ruoth Yesu nobi gi duongʼne duto miwuoro, nonege gi muya moa e dhoge kendo notiek tekone duto.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.8"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "9",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:9"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "9",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Jal mochayo Chikno nobi kaluwore gi dwaro mar Satan ka en gi teko duto mar timo honni gi ranyisi mag miriambo,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "10",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:10"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "10",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "kokonyore gi kit wuond maricho duto mondo owitgo joma lal. Jogo lal nikech negitamore hero adiera makelo warruok.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.10",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.10"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "11",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:11"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "11",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Kuom mano Nyasaye ooronigi teko maduongʼ marundo pachgi mondo omi giyie gi weche mag miriambo,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.11"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "12",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:12"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "12",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "omiyo Ruoth nongʼad bura ni ji duto motamore yie adiera, ka gihero mana timo timbe maricho.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.12"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Chungʼuru motegno",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "13",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:13"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "13",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Owetewa ma Ruoth ohero, onego wadwokne Nyasaye erokamano kinde duto ka waparou nikech Nyasaye noyierou",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.13",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.13"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "nyaka aa chakruok mondo owaru komiyo ngimau doko maler kuom teko mar Roho Maler kaachiel gi yie muyiego kuom adiera.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.13",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.13"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "14",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:14"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "14",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Mano emomiyo noluongou kane urwako Injili mane wayalonu mondo un bende uyud duongʼ mar Ruodhwa Yesu Kristo.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.14",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.14"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "15",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:15"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "15",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Kuom mano, jowetewa, chunguru motegno, kendo makuru matek puonj mane wapuonjou gi dhowa kata gi barupewa.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.15"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "16",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:16"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "16",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Mad Ruodhwa Yesu Kristo owuon kod Nyasaye Wuonwa, ma noherowa momiyowa jip mosiko kod geno maber, kuom ngʼwonone,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.16",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.16"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "17",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "2TH 2:17"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "17",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "ojiw chunyu kendo omiu teko e yore duto kendo e weche mabeyo.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "2TH.2.17",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "2TH.2.17"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "next": {
      "id": "2TH.3",
      "number": "3",
      "bookId": "2TH"
    },
    "previous": {
      "id": "2TH.1",
      "number": "1",
